# Ray 2.56.1 is required transitively by apache-airflow-providers-google 22.2.2.
# It embeds Jackson 2.18.6 in the shaded ray_dist.jar. The current Ray release has
# no build with the patched Jackson version; this narrowly scoped exception is for
# the embedded library only and must be removed when Ray publishes a patched build.
CVE-2026-54512
